{"articleNo":"738","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=738&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009학년도 한국과학재단 신입생 장학금 신청안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.02.23","hit":"23636","attachments":[{"name":"신규온라인신청요령(지역대학우수학생).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=738&attachNo=70195"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div align=\"left\">\n<table border=\"0\" width=\"520\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td width=\"520\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></font><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; COLOR: navy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font face=\"굴림\"><strong>2009학년도 한국과학재단 신입생 장학금 신청안내</strong></font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\"></font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#ba55d3\" size=\"3\" face=\"굴림\"><u><strong>&nbsp;지역대학우수학생 장학금</strong></u> </font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\"><br></font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 신청대상 : 국내 지방소재 이공계열 학과(부)에 입학한 2009학년도 우수 신입생</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 선발기준</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 대학수학능력시험 영역별 등급조건 충족 우수자</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 수리 “가” 및 과학탐구 2개 과목 모두 3등급 이내</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 대학별 입학성적 우수자</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 대학별 배정인원 범위내에서 해당 대학에서 추천하는 입학성적 우수자</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 신청절차 : 신청자 본인 온라인 개별신청 → 소속대학에 온라인 신청서 및 증빙서류 </font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;제출 </font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">라. 신청기한</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">○ 온라인 신청기간 : 2008. 4. 1(수) 14:00 ~ 4. 23(목)&nbsp; 18:00까지</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">○ 제출서류마감기간: 2008. 4. 1(수) ~ 4. 24(금)&nbsp; 18:00까지-학생과</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 신청방법 </font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 국가과학기술장학사업 홈페이지(</font></span><a href=\"http://scholarship.kosef.re.kr/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">http://scholarship.kosef.re.kr/</font></span></a><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">) </font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;의 “지역대학우수학생지원” 메뉴로 접속하여 2009년도 지역대학우수학생</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;신규신청화면에서 온라인 신청</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">- 자세한 신청방법은 추후 공지예정인 온라인 신청요령을 참조</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 신청자는 신청서 및 대학수학능력시험 성적표 사본 각각 2부 학생과 제출</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;바. 제출서류 : </font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">(글로벌관 4층 431호 학생과로 제출)</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 온라인 신청서 (신청자 전원)</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 대학수학능력시험 성적표 사본 2부 (해당자)</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 기초생활수급자 증빙 서류 2부 (해당자)</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 소속대학 입학시 교부받은 장학증서 사본 2부 (해당자)</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 2009년도 1학기 등록금 납부영수증 사본 2부 (신청자 전원)</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 기본증명서 2부 (신청자 전원) </font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">※ 동 주민센터 발급</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;사. 장학금액 : 대학 재학중 등록금의 50% 지원(지원기준 성적충족시)</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 타 장학금과 중복수혜 불가능 </font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;기타문의사항 : 054-478-7045<br></font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\"><br></font></span></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;2009. 03. 02.</font></span></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\"><br></font></span></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font face=\"굴림\"><strong>학&nbsp;&nbsp; 생&nbsp; 과 </strong></font></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
